=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Ayame} for a starting cut-scene, agree twice to start the quest.
* Go to {z:Port Bastok} and talk with {n:Ravorara} (E-7) outside the Steaming Sheep Restaurant for a cutscene.
** if you have {q:Fallen Comrades|Fallen Comrades|Fallen Comrades} open you will have to finish that before Ravorara will start this portion of Out of Depths.
* Go to {z:Oldton Movalpolos} and talk to {n:Brakobrik} (K-10).
** Closest warp is via {p:Proto-Waypoint} to the {p:Geomagnetic Fount} at (K-11) if you have it.
* Kill {m:Ancient Bombs|Ancient Bomb} in Oldton Movalpolos to get {i:Hoary Bomb Ash|Hoary Bomb Ash|1669}. At least 1 ash will always drop from a bomb, with up to 3 dropping with Treasure Hunter. **Obtain 11 bomb ash in total.**
* Trade between 1 to 4 Hoary Bomb Ash to {n:Brakobrik} at (K-11) to receive 4 different key items. You can only have one of each key item; trading the same amount of ashes twice will just waste the ashes. He'll offer you the following key items in exchange for the ash:
** Trade 1 ash for the {@k} {k:Dusty tome} - (100 gil from Ravorara)
** Trade 2 ash for the {@k} {k:Pointed jug} - (200 gil from Ravorara)
** Trade 3 ash for the {@k} {k:Cracked club} - (300 gil from Ravorara)
** Trade 4 ash for the {@k} {k:Peeling hairpin} - (400 gil from Ravorara)
* After getting the 4 key items, return to Port Bastok and talk to Ravorara four (4) times, once for each key item. You will see a cutscene and receive gil for each key item, as listed above.
* Return to Oldton Movalpolos and trade the final/11th ash to {n:Brakobrik} at (K-11), but choose "No Thanks" when he offers to give you something in return. He'll give you the {@k} {k:Old nametag}.
* Return to Port Bastok and talk with Ravorara for another cutscene.
* Go to {z:Bastok Mines} and talk with {n:Pavvke} in his residence on the lower level (I-7) for a cutscene, completing the quest and receiving your reward.

